# Keep secrets and local state OUT of the built image.
# The Dockerfile does "COPY . ." — without this, .env (which holds a live API
# key) is baked into every layer. Verified on 2026-07-31: the file was present
# at /app/.env inside the running container on the VPS.
# The key now reaches the app at RUNTIME via docker-compose env_file, so it
# stays on the host and never enters an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.venv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.chroma/
tests/
eval/
.pytest_cache/
